                                    [
                                        "vis",
                                        [
                                            {
                                                "t": "{wi}Fan art{\/wi} is unofficial drawings and other renderings of famous characters. \u0022Push the boundaries,\u0022 said Brian Kesinger, an artist at Walt Disney Animation Studios who sells his own prints on the side. \u0022{wi}Fan art{\/wi} isn\u0027t about rules. It\u0027s about expressing yourself.\u0022",
                                                "aq": {
                                                    "auth": "Jonathan Horn"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "t": "And the Slender Man story itself inspired everything from video games to {wi}fanart{\/wi} to a \u2026 horror film.",
